    "text": "7 hours ago\nWILLIAMSBURG CO., S.C. (WCSC) — Six women have been charged in a multi-county insurance fraud investigation. On Tuesday, Robin Latee Smith, 42, was charged with presenting a false claim for insurance payment – valued more than $2,000 but less than $10,000 and forgery – valued at less than $10,000.\nRead full article\n1",
